80_980503853649653_4480502916857009795_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Bi_GWrunrPoQ7kNvwHkr4an&_nc_oc=AdmzBMfsrSfoNClSi_gYZcRNnqfyJ7yjAb-sg8UyvM8o9c6NHMBAWkGjgpxDjHXIkrM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afz75eGDLjtfVpEh9FIO76DbMNGYh56kXqZe42CwR8ZI2w&oe=69B01D15"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "P1.png", "id": "1524334651830823", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75223475_1524334655164156_5919903215483884694_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WuqVDLiTzr4Q7kNvwHdRRFu&_nc_oc=Adl4-WZS7RZoBFFy7Pf6_oTehIq4g1bs9ALumgJrDNAbNPcCpa5yyol4l3QGAQKo5k8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afy8NuWUV1Sfsrq_ZB5JJnVqGqlb-1TxFWMFXD6ojaRuNQ&oe=69B00B78"}, "display_name": "Mimadim", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Mimadim Visualize is a cutting-edge software that allows you to visualize ceramic tiles and house tiles on your walls in stunning 3D. With a wide range of colors, patterns, and designs to choose from, you can easily experiment with different combinations to find the perfect look for your space.\n\nProduct Features:\n\n- Easy-to-use interface for seamless design exploration.\n\n- Wide selection of ceramic tiles and house tiles to choose from.\n\n- Realistic 3D rendering for a true-to-life visualization.\n\n- Customize tile layouts and patterns to suit your preferences.\n\n- Save and share your designs with others for feedback.\n\n- Perfect for homeowners, interior designers, and tile manufacturers.\n\n- Enhance your design process and make confident decisions about tile selection.\n\n- Experience your space in a whole new way with Mimadim Visualize.", "short_description": "Mimadim Visualize is a cutting-edge software that allows you to visualize ceramic tiles and house tiles on your walls in stunning 3D."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.mimadim.co.il/PPolicy_English.html", "developer_terms_of